      "Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria": "<p>Given a returning customer with saved payment details, when they reach checkout, then their saved method is available for selection without re-entering card details. </p><p>Given a customer who opts to save payment details, when payment completes, then the details are stored for future checkouts. </p><p>Given a saved method used at checkout, when payment completes, then the customer reaches the confirmation page. </p>",
