      "System.Description": "<p><b>Context:</b> Returning customers re-enter full card details on every order; checkout for returning customers averages 2m40s. No payment data is stored today. </p><p><b>Reason:</b> Q4 growth goal: +15% conversion for returning customers; payment-data entry is the 3rd-highest drop-off point in funnel analytics. </p><p><b>Scope:</b> Web checkout, cards via the current PSP. Out of scope: native apps, wallets, bank transfers. </p>",
